# Upstream's GitHub Pages showcase deploy workflow. Kept on disk, not committed:
# it deploys the public showcase, which a private repo cannot do without Pro, and
# the gh OAuth token in use has no `workflow` scope, so GitHub rejects every push
# that contains it. Delete this line to restore the file to version control.
.github/workflows/pages.yml
